---
// The group-challenge loop, drawn from the project's spec (PLAN/desafios.md). It is a diagram, not a screenshot: the challenge screens are in TestFlight, not on the App Store.
---
<figure class="loop wide">
  <p class="loop-tag">In TestFlight · not on the App Store</p>
  <ol aria-label="The challenge loop in five steps">
    <li><b>Create</b>A name, a deadline of one week, one month or a date, an optional cover.</li>
    <li><b>Invite</b>One link for the group chat. Without the app, it opens the store and shows the code.</li>
    <li><b>Join</b>Sign in with Apple, pick the name the group sees. Joining is always free.</li>
    <li><b>Fill up</b>Log it on the spot, with a photo of the odometer. That photo is what counts.</li>
    <li><b>Scoreboard moves</b>“+230 km in the challenge · you are 2nd”, right after saving.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="loop-back"><span aria-hidden="true">↺</span> Steps 4 and 5 repeat for as long as the challenge runs. The scoreboard is the reason for the next fill-up.</p>
  <figcaption><slot /></figcaption>
</figure>
